{"t":"2026-10-26T11:09:52.165Z","elapsed_s":568.712,"kind":"stop","op":"log","input":null,"reaction":"Selected I am stopping in Feedback, typed nothing, did not submit. I stop on Ramadan 2 at 17:30. Day 1 gave me everything I lost last time - the mosque, the doctor, Hacer, Selin on the phone, a walk instead of a cigarette - and the clock stopped for every scene, so I could read. Day 2 is the old race again: twelve hours in twenty seconds, a promised shift dissolved into sleep, Skip running past the moment I was waiting for. I know what I want for Halil - 300 lira by Ramadan 15 - and I cannot hold the day still long enough to ask. Better than last time, honestly much better. Not enough to keep me tonight.","game_clock":null,"engagement":null,"reason":"FRUSTRATED","op_ms":0,"error":null,"requested_control_present_before":null}
